">L</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub></math> so <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></msub></math> so it is a case of cooling<br />Similarly for<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> : Isochoric process with increasing in pressure so by <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub></math> so <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub></math> so it is a case of cooling"
